            Northern California's premier Olympic and Folkstyle wrestling academy. Building athletic discipline, character, and state champions in the East Bay.
          </p>
          <div class="footer-alert">
            USA WRESTLING RTC #513 SANCTIONED CLUB
          </div>
          <div class="footer-social-row">
            <a href="https://instagram.com/uwc_wrestling" target="_blank" class="footer-social-link" aria-label="United Wrestling Club on Instagram">
